@layout "layout.nview"

@section "content"

<div class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">{{ subjudul }}</p>
    <span class="version-pill">Rikat Declarative / PrimeNG-Style</span>
</div>

<div class="prose">
    <p>Komponen penunjuk posisi hierarki navigasi ala <code>&lt;p-breadcrumb&gt;</code> di PrimeNG menggunakan tag <code>&lt;l-breadcrumb&gt;</code>. Menyajikan jejak navigasi terstruktur dengan separator ikon otomatis dan tautan yang ramah SEO.</p>

    <!-- 1. Breadcrumb Berikon dengan Atribut items -->
    <div class="component-card">
        <div class="component-header">
            <span class="component-title">Breadcrumb Model Data (&lt;l-breadcrumb items="..."&gt;)</span>
            <button type="button" class="btn-copy-code"><l-icon name="copy" size="13"></l-icon> <span>Salin</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="component-canvas">
            <div style="width: 100%;">
                <l-breadcrumb items='[{"label":"Beranda","url":"/","icon":"home"},{"label":"Komponen UI","url":"/komponen","icon":"layers"},{"label":"Breadcrumb Navigasi"}]'></l-breadcrumb>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="component-code">
            <pre><code>&lt;!-- PrimeNG-Style Breadcrumb Deklaratif Model --&gt;
&lt;l-breadcrumb items='[
    {"label": "Beranda", "url": "/", "icon": "home"},
    {"label": "Komponen UI", "url": "/komponen", "icon": "layers"},
    {"label": "Breadcrumb Navigasi"}
]'&gt;&lt;/l-breadcrumb&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Breadcrumb dengan Elemen Anak Langsung -->
    <div class="component-card">
        <div class="component-header">
            <span class="component-title">Breadcrumb Beranak Tautan HTML Langsung</span>
            <button type="button" class="btn-copy-code"><l-icon name="copy" size="13"></l-icon> <span>Salin</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="component-canvas">
            <div style="width: 100%;">
                <l-breadcrumb>
                    <a href="/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.35rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;"><l-icon name="grid" size="14"></l-icon> <span>Dasbor</span></a>
                    <a href="/dok" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;">Dokumentasi</a>
                    <a href="/dok/arsitektur" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none;">Arsitektur</a>
                    <span style="color: #f4f4f5; font-weight: 600;">Pangatur (Controller)</span>
                </l-breadcrumb>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="component-code">
            <pre><code>&lt;!-- Breadcrumb dengan Anak Tag Langsung --&gt;
&lt;l-breadcrumb&gt;
    &lt;a href="/"&gt;&lt;l-icon name="grid"&gt;&lt;/l-icon&gt; Dasbor&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a href="/dok"&gt;Dokumentasi&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;a href="/dok/arsitektur"&gt;Arsitektur&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;Pangatur (Controller)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/l-breadcrumb&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom-nav">
        <a href="/komponen/pagination" class="btn-page-nav btn-page-nav-prev"><l-icon name="arrow-left" size="15"></l-icon><span>Sebelumnya: Paginasi Data</span></a>
        <a href="/komponen/navigasi" class="btn-page-nav btn-page-nav-next"><span>Selanjutnya: Tab &amp; Segmen</span><l-icon name="arrow-right" size="15"></l-icon></a>
    </div>
</div>

@rampung
